Active Immunity Workshop modding docs and tools
Copyright (c) 2026 Dylpickle Studios. All rights reserved.

This repository is not open source. It is published so players can make
Steam Workshop mods for Active Immunity. Everything not granted below
remains reserved.

1. Example mod (examples/)

   You may copy, modify and publish the example mod, in whole or in part,
   as the starting point for your own Active Immunity Workshop mods. No
   attribution is required.

2. Upload scripts (tools/upload_workshop_mod.sh, tools/upload_workshop_mod.ps1)

   You may use, copy and modify the upload scripts to publish your Active
   Immunity Workshop mods, and share modified copies with other mod authors
   for the same purpose.

3. Documentation (README.md, AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md)

   You may read and use the documentation to make Active Immunity mods,
   including giving it to an AI assistant that is helping you do so. You
   may quote short passages when helping others make mods.

4. Validation code (tools/validate_workshop_mod.gd,
   src/progression/workshop_content_registry.gd, project.godot)

   You may download and run this code, including locally modified copies
   for your own debugging, solely to check mods for Active Immunity. You may
   not redistribute it, publish modified versions, or use it, or any part
   of it, in other software. src/progression/workshop_content_registry.gd
   is part of the Active Immunity game and is shared only so the validator
   gives the same results as the game.

Active Immunity, the game itself, its code, art, audio and other assets are
not part of this repository and are not licensed by it.

THE CONTENTS OF THIS REPOSITORY ARE PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF
ANY KIND. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM,
DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY ARISING FROM THEIR USE.
